//   <..+0x3f8>,eax (a3 store AGAIN — the >=0 path re-stores) / cmp eax,5 /
//   jle ret / mov dword <..+0x3f8>,5 (c7 05) / ret.  CPBombRange (0x3e260)
//   is the _bombRange twin.  Volatile-typed accesses keep CL's CSE from
